  m_text: '1. ARRANGE ITEMS

    Drag items into your inventory grid. Press R or right-click to rotate them. Remove items to make space.


    2. DISCOVER SYNERGIES

    Place compatible items next to each other to activate special effects and bonuses.


    3. MANAGE YOUR RESOURCES

    Earn Score to reach each wave''s target. Keep Darkness below 100 or the game ends.


    4. SURVIVE FIVE WAVES

    Resolve your inventory by pressing End Wave. Reach the required Score Target and survive the Darkness penalty to advance.'
